constData.costDesc:
After unlocking Case Investigation, <color=#CC6E3B>6</color> Authorized Investigation Permits can be obtained at <color=#CC6E3B>04:00</color> every day;
Up to <color=#CC6E3B>12</color> Authorized Investigation Permits can be held at any time, and excess ones will be discarded;
During Case Investigations, every investigation will consume <color=#CC6E3B>1</color> Authorized Investigation Permit.

constData.harvestDesc:
The current Technological transformation rate will affect the time needed to complete a single transformation;
Technological transformation rate can be increased by unlocking the Case Investigation system and increasing investigation progress, and any increase in the rate will take effect at <color=#CC6E3B>04:00</color> the next day;
Up to <color=#CC6E3B>16</color> [Technological Investigation Supplies] from Technological transformation can be held, and transformation progress will be halted after reaching the limit;
When unlocking any area, <color=#CC6E3B>2</color> [Technological Investigation Supplies] will be rewarded (Supplies rewarded from area unlocks will not count towards the limit).

